/
/THE FOLLOWING ROUTINE IS EXECUTED WITH
/INTERRUPT OFF. IT IS CALLED WHEN A FORM FEED OR OTHER
/EQUIVALENT DELIMITER HAS BEEN APPENDED FROM THE
